		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="17240"></a><b>Oathtender</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Supreme Majestrix of Pointy Things<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/mod6sword.gif" alt="Vizier" title="Vizier" border="0" /><br /><img src="images/avatars/gallery/general/allseeingeye.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 22 Aug 2002<br />Posts: 860<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17240&amp;sid=4304614022e574f73f9afd830d3dbc09#17240"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Apr 21, 2004 11:03 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: WoW</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17240&amp;sid=4304614022e574f73f9afd830d3dbc09"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Some of us folks that have stayed in contact have been tossing around the idea of going to WoW when it goes live. Just thought I'd drop you all a line and let you know kind of where we some of us are headed. Me, I need the most casual game out there, because I'm lucky if I have an hour a week to log in and play anymore. <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
I'm missing y'all, and wish I had the time to come back. If they'd manage to stretch out the day to 48 hours, it might happen. <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
Oh, and I'm not sure who knew, but as of March 16th, 9:37 pm, I became the mother of two beautiful little girls. That's -total-, I did NOT have twins.  <img src="images/smiles/icon_lol.gif" alt="icon_lol.gif" border="0" /> And number one is just at that age where she wants to help mommy help the baby, but has no idea of her own strength or the delicateness of her younger sibling, and otherwise is trying to get into every bloody thing that she possibly shouldn't be in... so it's been an adventure, and is mostly what's sucking up all of my time lately. I do hope you're all doing well.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
