		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17241&amp;sid=4304614022e574f73f9afd830d3dbc09#17241"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Apr 22, 2004 2:21 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17241&amp;sid=4304614022e574f73f9afd830d3dbc09"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Well, congratulations on being warden, err, Mom of 2 young girls!  
<br />

<br />
WoW, haven't given it too much thought as my time available for games is limited as well and right now I can only afford to pay for one online addiction. <img src="images/smiles/icon_biggrin.gif" alt="icon_biggrin.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
Although, do keep us up to date on where you are if you go to WoW and who knows who will drop by for a fight or two  <img src="images/smiles/icon_wink.gif" alt="icon_wink.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
And, if the day ever does go to 48 hours, I look forward to seeing you here, as with that much time we should be able to get a bunch of us in some kind of trouble!
<br />

<br />
Take care and congratulations again on your new addition and your little Momma's Helper!
<br />

<br />

<br />
Tommie
<br />
The Guy Behind Ceowulf</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
