			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17244&amp;sid=4304614022e574f73f9afd830d3dbc09#17244"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Apr 28, 2004 7:14 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17244&amp;sid=4304614022e574f73f9afd830d3dbc09"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Love that idea of the sliding XP Bonus!  I had never heard of that before.  Great idea both for the casual gamer and the whole image of the game companies not wanting you to  ever log off.   Take care and be safe.
<br />

<br />

<br />
Tommie
<br />

<br />
The Guy Behind Ceowulf</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
